{"title":"ITest Problems and Solutions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The title of this article has been capitalized due to technical restrictions. The correct title should be '</i><b>iTest Problems and Solutions'</b><i>.</i></dd></dl>\n<p>This is a list of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ITest\" title=\"ITest\">iTest</a> competitions on the AoPSWiki. A list of the questions can also be found on the AoPS forum <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3435\">here</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Main_Test\">Main Test</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ITest_Problems_and_Solutions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Main Test\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest\" title=\"2005 iTest\">2005 iTest</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest\" title=\"2006 iTest\">2006 iTest</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest\" title=\"2007 iTest\">2007 iTest</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest\" title=\"2008 iTest\">2008 iTest</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tournament_of_Champions\">Tournament of Champions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ITest_Problems_and_Solutions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Tournament of Champions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c696542\">2007 iTest ToC</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c680215\">2008 iTest ToC</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20